BED v3 — NOTICE

This repository contains an academic, open-science implementation of the
Behavioral Engine for Demand (BED) v3 for research, teaching, and reproducibility
purposes.

The following components are intentionally NOT included in this repository:

1. Advanced CMDP tuning parameters
2. Proprietary reward engineering logic
3. Real-world deployment data
4. Partner integrations or production APIs
5. Internal research notes, experiments, or unpublished extensions
6. Future versions of BED (v4, v5, v6, etc.)

The public version of BED v3 is designed to demonstrate the architecture,
simulation framework, and prototype flow, but it does not include the full
intellectual property required to deploy BED in production environments.

For collaboration inquiries, please contact the project author.
